;; the prologue walked. Premises are THE SEAM: the mask home read, the two
;; state-home reads (as FREE Xmm values sA/sC -- the pack chains stay
;; FOLDED applications, so at composition time, with literal reads, the
;; article's shnp_pack_abef/cdgh laws fire on them BY REWRITING; computing
;; the chains here would strand match-residues inside the stuck tail,
;; where no later compute can descend), and the src window bounds. The
;; three pointer bumps collapse via mod_unique at q=0; the eight load
;; gates discharge by farkas from the two bound premises.
(claim shn_law_pro
  (goal
    ((f Nat)
